          "properties": {
            "altText": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Column chart of median return on budget by production-budget band. The shape is a U. Films under 1 million dollars return 4.98 times their budget, the 15 to 30 million band returns only 1.41 times, and films of 100 million and above return 2.70 times. The rank correlation between budget and return is minus 0.11, so spending more does not improve return.'"
